Third-party code vendored into this directory
=============================================

ERAM scope (eram/, shared/, idle-timer.js, ERAMv110.ttf)
--------------------------------------------------------
Source:  https://github.com/yanjz124/SwimReader
Path:    tools/SwimServer/wwwroot/
Author:  yanjz124

Used with the author's permission.

At the time of vendoring the upstream repository carried no LICENSE file, so
no open-source grant applies by default and permission is the only basis for
inclusion here. If you fork this site or reuse this directory, that permission
does not automatically extend to you — ask the author.

These files are kept byte-for-byte as fetched so they can be refreshed by
re-downloading. All aerocenter-specific wiring lives OUTSIDE this directory:

    radar/eram/sim-bridge.js      feeds the scope from a saved scenario
    radar/sim/scenario-player.js  the simulation itself
    radar/eram/index.html         generated by scripts/build-eram-page.js
    radar/eram/eram.css           generated; only the @font-face URL differs

Upstream expects a .NET server (SwimServer) relaying live FAA SWIM data over a
WebSocket. Nothing of that server is included, and no live data is used: the
scope here is driven entirely by scenario files in radar/scenarios/.


Leaflet (leaflet/)
------------------
Source:  https://leafletjs.com  (npm: leaflet@1.9.4)
License: BSD-2-Clause — see leaflet/LICENSE

Vendored rather than loaded from unpkg.com so the scope does not depend on a
third-party CDN being reachable.
